window.products.push({"id":740025,"name":"TYZU 7 Inch Portable Fan, Misting Fan, 4000 mAh Battery Operated Fan, Outdoor Misting Fan With 2 Mist Modes & 4 Speeds, 130ml Tank, 360° Rotatable, Cl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hzTSz0rWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Refreshing Misting Fan】There are 2 mist modes: continuous mode and intermittent mode. This battery operated misting fan can work for 1-2 h with a build-in 130ml water tank. TYZU clip on misting fan can blow and circulate the air around you, besides it can bring cooling mist to reduce your body temperature quicker than a normal clip on fan. Take away this cooling fan, take away your discomfort from the heat 【Natural Wind & 3 Speeds Airflow】TYZU portable misting fan has 4 speeds in total to fit your needs. The 1st speed is natural wind mode (sleeping wind mode), which alternates between a high speed and slow speed automatic for 4s. You can choose the other 3 speeds to fit your needs. This personal fan has 3 wide blades and a high-speed motor, max speed is 15 ft/s, and the rotation is 2000 to 4300 RPM. is ideal for those looking for airflow and a refreshing mist in daily life, traveling, and camping 【Strong Grip Clamp】Made of sturdy and durable ABS material, its grip clamp is ultra-stable to keep this portable clip on fan firmly in place even when working at the highest speed, and can clip on any surface up to 2 inches. The personal fan is great for different outdoor occasions, golf carts, camping tents, baby strollers, treadmills, and car backseats, it is also suitable for indoor use as desk fan for office, bedroom and dormitory. 【360°Rotation & 2 Light Modes & 3 Timer Settings】This portable fan with misting can be rotated 360° horizontally and vertically, so you can direct the air where you need and enjoy the cool wind from all angles. This portable fan has 2 night light modes, the warm and soft lights can accompany you at bedtime. Comes with 3 timers (2H/4H/6H), customizing your own time for the USB fan to turn it off automatically. Note: During use, please keep the water injection hole facing up when it is filled with water 【Easy to Carry & Powerful Battery Capacity】The size of this misting stroller fan is 10.2 X 7 X 4.7 inches and weighs 1.7 lb. It’s lightweight and easy to take the outdoor personal fan where you want to go. This USB fan has a 4000mAh rechargeable battery, and can work for 3.5-10 hours after a full charge. The micro type-c port is compatible with multiple devices including laptops, cell phone adapters, mobile power, and USB charger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hzTSz0rWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TYZU","source_asin":"B0BQMH3T56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQMH3T56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQMH3T56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
