window.products.push({"id":740089,"name":"AVF FSL930CHEO-A Chepstow Combination TV Stand and Mount - 930 - Oak Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711dq8wkZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Designed with you… combining experience and insight in consumer trends with the largest ever research project of living rooms, AVF has discovered which tv stands people really want. our research identified three key areas… Style: The real wood veneers and black glass of the affinity collection have been selected to blend technology seamlessly with modern decor styles. versatility: the space saving curved designs in the affinity collection have been developed to allow them to sit perfectly along flat walls, as well as in corners. Cables: cable mess behind tvs is a real turn off. All tv stands in the affinity collection have been designed to subtly channel and manage cables out of sight, for a tidier finish. Affinity tv stand collection: the chepstow series is a free standing column in beautiful real wood veneer with integrated floating glass shelf. The design of the column provides superb cable management. From the Manufacturer Combining experience and insight into customer needs, along with the largest ever research project into how people interact in their living rooms, AVF has discovered what people truly look for in a TV stand. Presenting the AVF Affinity collection--a selection of TV stands that bring style, versatility, and superior cable management into any home. The real wood veneers and black glass of the Affinity collection have been selected to blend technology seamlessly with modern decor styles. The space-saving curved designs of the collection have been developed to allow them to sit perfectly along flat walls, as well as in corners. And all TV stands in the Affinity series have been designed to subtly channel and manage cables out of sight, for a tidier finish. Fingertip adjustments make it easy to find the perfect viewing angle Real wood veneers and black glass seamlessly blend your technology with modern decor styles Chepstow Series Designed to fit neatly into the corner this TV stand and mount in wood veneer is the perfect answer for both style and functionality. Chepstow's elegant column provides a fantastic channel for the management of cables and co-ordinates beautifully with the soft curves of the base. The base is raised by a hidden plinth and the floating shelf, in black safety glass, provides excellent space for ancillary equipment. Open Shelf Design with Integrated TV Mount This TV stand and mount, in wood veneer and with a floating black glass shelf, is perfect for positioning in the corner or flat to the wall. For the perfect viewing angle there is fingertip adjustment to the tilting AVF mount with up to an 18 degree tilt. Further adjustment comes from the height adjustable mount position on the column. Cable Management As with all AVF products, cable management is provided to ensure ease of routing for the TV and associated AV equipment. The curved column design offers excellent cable management for TV and accessory cables. Incredibly Easy to Assemble The Affinity series features simple, do-it-yourself installation usually requiring nothing more than a screwdriver. The cabinet has safety glass tested to British Standard 6202a and is simple to place. Technical Specifications Screen Sizes: up to 50\" (127cm) Screen Sizes: up to 50\" (127cm) Maximum TV Weight: 81lbs (37kg) Maximum TV Weight: 81lbs (37kg) VESA Compatibility: 75x75mm to 660x400mm VESA Compatibility: 75x75mm to 660x400mm Number of Shelves: 2 (including base) Number of Shelves: 2 (including base) Maximum Lower Shelf Weights: 1st - 33lbs (15kg); 2nd - 55lbs (25kg) Maximum Lower Shelf Weights: 1st - 33lbs (15kg); 2nd - 55lbs (25kg)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711dq8wkZnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVF","source_asin":"B0079TOERU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0079TOERU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0079TOERU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
