window.products.push({"id":740153,"name":"Hillman 848782 No Parking No Estacionarse 2 Sided Reversible Bilingual Spanish and English Sign, Black and Red Plastic, 8x12 Inches 1-Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177xB0Ou0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description No Parking / No Estacionarse Sign defines an area where motorists or drivers should not park. Its high contrast lettering ensures high visibility from a distance. The bold text is easily legible, and sends the message across clearly. The sign has No Parking / No Estacionarse text in bold red against a reflective black background. It should be placed horizontally near the designated no parking area where it is easily seen by approaching motorists or drivers. It is made using Styrene, a type of high strength plastic. Styrene is an extremely durable material that is flexible and resistant to wear and tear. It can withstand most environments and will not fade in extreme temperatures. The ultra-violet fluorescent ink used ensures maximum visibility from different viewing angles. Installation: The Styrene Plastic Sign can easily be installed on any surface with tape or nails. Suitable for commercial and residential use. About The Hillman Group: The Hillman Group is a renowned brand leader for home hardware and home improvement products. It was started in 1964 as a fastener company, growing to well over 130,000 SKU's since. Hillman focuses on providing quality, service and innovation. Made in USA. This item is sold individually as a single pack, 1-Sign. From the Manufacturer This is a plastic bilingual sign \"No Parking\" is written in both Spanish and English for extra clarity.). Black background with easy-to-read, red letters. Highly visible sign to indicate that parking is not allowed in this area. Plastic material can be used indoors or outdoors. The 8-Inch by 12-Inch sign is durable with a high tensile and tear strength. It communicates the message in fluorescent colors. The sign is 2-sided.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177xB0Ou0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hillman","source_asin":"B01MT7UCGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT7UCGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT7UCGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
