window.products.push({"id":740231,"name":"Devrig 2 Packs 21.6V Lithium Battery for Dyson DC62 DC59 DC58 SV03 SV04 SV09 V6 Animal Motorhead V6 Slim V6 Absolute V6 Fluffy Vacuum Battery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NSHubOrsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accurate Technology - V6 Replacement Battery:: Compatible with Dyson V6 series vacuum: →V6 Absolute,V6 Animal , V6 Motorhead, V6 Slim. → DC58 DC59 DC61 DC62 DC72 DC74. →SV03 SV04 SV05 SV06 SV07 SV09, 595 650 770 880 vacuum. →V6 Car+ Boat,V6 Top Dog,V6 Mattress,V6 Trigger, V6 Trigger Pro Excl, V6 Multifloor Exclusive, V6 Top Dog HEPA, V6 Trigger Extra, V6 Baby+ Child Vacuum. Product Details: Battery Capacity: 2500mAh Voltage: 21.6 Volt Battery Type: Lithium ion Color: Grey Condition: New Warm Tips about Charging & Storing: 1). A new battery will only be partially charged and will require a full charge prior to use. After 2-3 times regular use (charge/discharge), the battery can be fully activated and achieve optimum performance. 2). To help prolong battery life, avoid recharging immediately after a full discharge. Allow cooling for a few minutes. Using standard mode first in everyday use, MAX mode will shorten use time. 3). Sometimes the vacuum tools would stop running temporarily when the battery is too hot. Please let it cool down 5-10 minutes, and the battery still has some buffer capacity. Then you will find the vacuum tools would start running again. 4). If doesn't use it for a long time, the battery will self-discharge, please fully charge it before use. If the battery is standing idle, please charge it every 2-3 months to prevent irreversible capacity loss caused by self-discharge.It is recommended to store the battery in cool, dry and well-ventilated at 3℃~20℃.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NSHubOrsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Devrig","source_asin":"B09KV7BBP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KV7BBP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KV7BBP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
