window.products.push({"id":740267,"name":"Marwiba Air Fryer Liners Disposable 120 Pcs 2-8 Qt with Oil Brush Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liners Non-Stick AirFryer Liners for Frying, Baking & Coo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ksX9-sIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥘【𝗦𝗶𝘁 𝗕𝗮𝗰𝗸 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗥𝗲𝗹𝗮𝘅】Rather than cleaning your aging air fryer every time after use, put your time to better by using our air fryer parchment paper liner. Marwiba disposable air fryer paper liners ensure that no oil seepage occurs. The walls do not flatten to let the food fall off. At the end of the cooking, just relish the eating experience without the need to clean the air fryer or utensils. Simply throw away the air fryer parchment paper. 🥘【𝗦𝗮𝘃𝗼𝗿 𝗧𝗮𝘀𝘁𝘆 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗛𝗲𝗮𝗹𝘁𝗵𝘆 𝗙𝗼𝗼𝗱】With no harmful chemicals, fluorescent or bleach, you get exactly the taste that you want when your air fryer has finished the job with our air fryer liner. Being resistant to high temperatures up to 445°F / 230℃, our Marwiba Food Grade parchment paper for air fryer ensures that the food doesn't stick to the paper. 🥘【𝗙𝗲𝗲𝗹 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗦𝘁𝗿𝗲𝗻𝗴𝘁𝗵 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗦𝗶𝗹𝗶𝗰𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴𝘀】Marwiba airfryer paper liners are built with 40gsm pure wood pulp compounded with fine layers of food-grade inert silicone on both sides of the liners. Not only does the air fryer paper avoid oil leakage, they also prevent any tearing off of the liner while in use. 𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝘄𝗮𝗹𝗹𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝘁𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗲𝗿 𝘀𝗺𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝘄𝗲𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝘀, unlike other Air Fryer Sheets sheets that quickly lose shape. 🥘【𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗘𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘆𝘄𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲】Microwave oven, baking oven, or air fryers, Air Fryer Paper Liners are your friend everywhere. When not cooking, utilize them to decorate your tables at home and at picnics with families and friends. Use the provided brush as part of air fryer accessories to gently smear oil on a wide range of delicious foods including chicken wings, nuggets, fish, onion rings, pizza, doughnuts etc. The round shape of disposable air fryer liners is universal and would fit both square and round air fryers. 🥘【𝗖𝗔𝗨𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡】Please respect the guidelines of your air fryer. No disposable air fryer plates shall be placed with little or no food to avoid localized food overheating or to avoid a gone-with-the-wind scenario. Let your air fryer preheat before you put the food in the tray. Then just leave the Marwiba liners for air fryer basket to do the magic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ksX9-sIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marwiba","source_asin":"B0BSXBBV3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSXBBV3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSXBBV3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
