window.products.push({"id":740400,"name":"Silicone Utensil Rest with Drip Pad for Multiple Utensils Spoon Rest BPA-Free Flexible Almond-Shaped Silicone Spoon Holder For utensil rack for spoons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pnDE1JE2L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"This silicone kitchenware set is flexible and easy to clean. It is an excellent supplement to basic kitchen knowledge. This useful heat-resistant spoon holder keeps the stove and countertop clean. The temperature range is -40 to 260 degrees Celsius, which can be safely used in ovens, microwaves, dishwashers and freezers. Four slots can accommodate multiple tableware and spoons, and a lip line is designed around the lip to prevent dripping. Reduce the space required for multitasking, reduce the hassle of using paper towels, and add value to any kitchen. The function of silicone kitchenware: Made of food-grade heat-resistant non-slip silicone. Durable, soft, and safe to the human body. Please use spoons, brushes, utensils, small tools and kitchen utensils. Other ideas for using silicone kitchenware: When grilling, put down the grill brush and fork with a fork When baking, put down the brush and spatula Painting Used for drawing Silicone kitchenware packaging includes: 1 silicone spoon holder and 4 silicone spoon holders. The size of the spoon is 5.5 x 5.3 x 1.5 inches, and the size of the spoon holder is 7.8 x 3.7 inches. The size can hold your largest cooking and eating tools, the best prices, the best quality products, and save money. Use and maintenance cleaning instructions: Before using it for the first time, please wash it with warm soapy water. You can also easily clean the dishwasher and return to the counter immediately. Order now and take advantage of our lifetime money-back guarantee! If you are not satisfied for any reason, please send us an email. We will give you a full refund or free replacement. We will reply within 24 hours. Happy cooking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pnDE1JE2L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jusen","source_asin":"B088LYQW25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LYQW25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LYQW25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":740401,"name":"Masterpiece Artist Canvas 44261 Monet PRO 1-1/2\" Deep, 24\" x 72\", Linen 12.0oz - 4X - Muir Acrylic Primed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fXqv3EXEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description This 24x72 size is in the 3:1 Aspect Ratio. Pure medium weight Belgian Linen finished to a primed weight of 12 oz.. It's double sized and double primed with archival quality acrylic gesso making the ground impervious to paints leaching through and harming the fabric. Suitable for most all paint types, like oils, acrylics, and alkyds. Linen is the world's strongest natural fiber. It has oils that keep it flexible and prevent disintegration over time. The surface has a characteristic linen texture. There is a 1/2\" gap between the canvas and frame, eliminating the unwanted lines that occur when the gap is less. We never use finger joints in our wood frames, which often fail under tension and over time - the glue joints give-up, and are unsuitable for paintings intended to last for centuries. The 3.25\" wide heavy-duty keyable cross braces allow the canvas frame to be tensioned in the middle, where the tension is needed the most...a unique design for which we earned a patent! This frame uses even larger 2.25\" wide Stretcher Bars for superior strength. Cross braces are glued and fastened at the “cross” for maximum support and rigidity. Both corner keys and brace keys are pre-installed. Stretched using our proprietary MuseumWrap method, producing a drum-tight-stretch up to 50% tighter than other methods, and with balanced tension across the surface. The corners are uncut and neatly folded, making it possible to remove and restretch the canvas on the same size frame. From the Manufacturer For 50+ years, the passion of the Masterpiece team is building the finest artist canvas in America.  Just touch one of these impressive products and you’ll immediately discern the quality characteristics that separate this canvas from any other. Masterpiece takes pride in using high quality materials, employing unparalleled workmanship, and continually upping the bar on quality. The importance of artists using a quality made canvas cannot be overstressed.  If you use high quality paints and brushes, then don’t waste your resources on an inferior canvas not worthy of your own time, talent, and reputation.Masterpiece canvases are built to last well beyond the artist's lifetime…into the next millennium.  Savvy art buyers and art enthusiasts understand that the value of a painting increases when the materials used to create it are of equal quality to the artwork itself.  Using a well-made canvas is an investment in your own legacy.Why are Masterpiece canvases so good?  It starts with the canvas itself.  Natural fiber canvas materials, like 100% cotton and Belgian Linen, are selected and inspected. A sizing is then applied to the canvas that becomes a barrier between the ultimate primer and the canvas material.  The primer is specifically designed to provide the ultimate surface upon which your paints will join with the canvas, either chemically and/or mechanically, providing a reliable base or ground for your art.The canvas is then mounted onto a state-of-the-art Monet Pro frame. When frame sizes are 16” or larger, a brace is applied to the frame; for example, a 16x20 has a single brace, and a 20x20 is cross braced in both directions. The braces prevent the stretcher bar frame from bowing-in so the canvas stays tighter….which is a welcome feature when you paint on the canvas, making the surface more responsive to the artist’s touch. And the canvas stays tight after it’s painted. To increase the tension further, press-in the corner keys and the brace keys further into the slots, which adds tension in the corners and the middle of the canvas, where the tension is needed the most!Monet Pro canvas is MuseumWrapped, which is Masterpiece’s proprietary stretching technique that achieves: a drum-tight stretch, balanced tension across the canvas surface, neatly folded un-cut corners, and paintable edges. It’s the absolute best way to stretch a canvas.When your art matters, choose Monet Pro…a truly professional canvas in every way!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fXqv3EXEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masterpiece","source_asin":"B0064J03JE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0064J03JE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0064J03JE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
