window.products.push({"id":740415,"name":"ChefGiant 5 Cup Flour Sifter Rotary Hand Crank Stainless Steel 16 Fine Mesh Screen, Corrosion Resistant Baking Sieve Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710jxIi6NxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPACT 5 CUP SIFTER: The 4” diameter x 6” high size is space-saving Capable of holding up to 5 cups of flour, this flour sifter will save you time during busy times in your bakery or home kitchen., while still allowing for high volume use. DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL CONSTRUCTION: This baking flour sifter is made of premium corrosion resistant stainless steel with a highly polished body. Unlike plastic and wood, stainless steel does not absorb bacteria or smells ensuring everlasting lifespan. The beater is chrome plated with wire reinforcement on the bottom. ROTARY HAND CRANK DESIGN: Squeeze handles are hard to work with and require strength, which means they can wear you out quickly. This flour sifters rotary hand crank design operates smoothly and effortlessly, it can stand up to repeated use without tiring out your hand. FINE MESH SIFTER: The 16 fine mesh screen has a smaller weave and holes for sifting finer ingredients. It will make the flour easier to incorporate and result in a lighter, more consistent product. It will also remove any unwanted lumps to create a final professional-tasting product every time. VERSATILE: This ChefGiant Hand Crank Flour Sifter will break up clumps and aerate flour, sugar, and other baking ingredients to give your baked goods a light and fluffy texture. Just add ingredients, turn the crank, and the result is a light, even, fine powder! Essential for cakes with a very light, delicate texture. Also perfect for flouring your work surface or giving food a light dusting of powdered sugar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710jxIi6NxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChefGiant","source_asin":"B07C1ZFDFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C1ZFDFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C1ZFDFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":740416,"name":"Privacy Window Film Red Orange Stained Glass Sliding Door Sticker for Office Bathroom Summer Deco Self Removable Anti UV Window Paper, 35.4\" x 78.7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ybvL6Wm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's nice to feel safe in your own place!Privacy Protection: The window Films create great 24 hours of privacy protection without sacrificing light, and no need to worry about someone spying on your privacy through the glass window. Glare Reduction: The sun beams in and is absolutely blinding. But with this over the window films, it brings in a lovely glow. Window stickers can significantly reduce glare when you watch TV or use a computer, cell phone, to help you work, relax, and entertain without added eye strain and discomfort from excessive light.User-Friendly: Beautiful and perfect amount of stickiness. Static cling allows for easy stick application, and easy removal leaving no damage or residue. Unique Patterns: Decorate your home windows with various vivid patterns, free up heavy expensive curtains or blinds and gives glass windows a pop of brilliant color appearance. Installation Instructions1. Cut film to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window2. Clean the target surface thoroughly and make sure the surface is clean enough without any dust. 3. Use the spray bottle wet the glass with water or soapy, more water better (NOT USE GLASS CLEANER).4. Peel off the back protective film (Sometime you will find it is difficult to tear off the protective film, you can try to tape the two sides with adhesive tape then peel off) VERY IMPORTANT!!!5. Stick film on glass (Put the smooth side to window, don’t put the frosted side to the window).6. Scrape a few more times with squeegee or cards to ensure the bubbles and water are completely removed.7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges. Tips: - This window film can show the colors when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before installation. - Use a hair dryer to soften the film under cold weather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ybvL6Wm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZPLANTCIQ","source_asin":"B09B9YWMLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B9YWMLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B9YWMLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
