window.products.push({"id":740660,"name":"Peaceful Classics Step Stool - Amish Handmade Kids Step Stool - Bathroom, Bedroom, Living Room Or Kitchen Step Stool for Adults - Multipurpose Foot St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RZ6iidd1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM OAK WOOD: Our step stool for adults and children is made of premium quality and sturdy oak wood with a warm finish. We hand-crafted this step stool using high-grade wooden material for superior durability even for heavyweight users. Our small wood stool for kids and adults comes fully assembled, so worry not about confusing installation diagrams and instructions. AMISH HANDMADE WOODEN FURNITURE: Made in Pennsylvania the same way for hundreds of years, this Amish step stool was handcrafted in Lancaster, PA and will stand the test of time. Our Amish Craftsmen are some of the most incredible people you'll come across. These Lancaster County craftsmen may not have their names plastered on the foot stool, but each artisan has a story built into each piece of oak wood furniture. MULTIPURPOSE: Our Small wooden stool for seniors and youngsters is the perfect furniture for your kitchen. It also suits other uses like bed ladder or small wooden stool for reaching high cabinets. This wooden furniture may be a functional shower stool or a lovely desk foot rest. EASY GRIP: Our Wooden Step Stool for Adults has an oval slat at the top for easy carrying. This feature makes it easy to bring it as an office foot rest or an outdoor small bench. A Step stool for Bed shouldn't be bulky or cumbersome. Safe to use by children and adults, our step stools were designed for excellent stability and balance. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: We are so confident in the quality of our premium quality step stool for kitchens, bedrooms, bathrooms and other applications. Our priority is to satisfy our customers and always try to give the customer the best quality products. Feel free to ask questions about our one step stool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RZ6iidd1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peaceful Classics","source_asin":"B07Q8678KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q8678KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q8678KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":740661,"name":"Emile Henry Bread Cloche, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZUrMQN9ZL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Emile Henry enters the artisan bread baking category with the Bread Cloche. The ceramic Bread Cloche with its bell shaped cover allows you to proof your bread directly in the bread cloche. The lid also traps steam from the baking bread to create an environment similar to a steam-injected oven. The steam gives the bread a crunchy, chewy crust. The Emile Henry Bread Cloche is sized for a round loaf made with 3-cups of flour. Recipe and Instruction booklet included. Like all Emile Henry products, the Bread Cloche is made of all natural materials and is backed by a ten-year warranty, which is not offered by any other ceramic manufacturers. Emile Henry is located in the Burgundy town of Marcigny, France.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZUrMQN9ZL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B00DQCC282","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DQCC282","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DQCC282","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
