window.products.push({"id":740666,"name":"Flexicomfort Knee Pillow for Side Sleepers - Removable Memory Foam Layers to Customize Thickness - Orthopedic Hip Pillow for Between Legs When Sleepin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xzPIA7kNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[MAXIMUM COMFORT with ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT] The Flexicomfort Knee Pillow is normally 31x22x23x14cm (12.2x8.6x9x5.5 inches), but if you detach one of the memory foam layers (2.5cm/1inches), you will have a 31x22x20.5x11.5cm (12.2x8.6x8x4.5 inches) knee pillow. If that is still thicker than you prefer, you can remove the second memory foam layer and have a knee pillow that measures 31x22x18x9cm (12.2x8.6x7x3.5 inches). Customize your pillow until it’s the perfect size for you! [TAKES the PRESSURE OFF YOUR KNEES and LOWER BACK with MULTI-POSITION DESIGN] and truly aligns your spine. It works great when placed between legs in multiple positions to eliminate bone-on-bone contact. If you seem to always wake up with a sore lower back, you will also experience less hip, back and knee pain in the mornings when using this pillow. You can also SPLIT it into TWO HALVES to elevate both legs. This will help with knee and back pain relief and pressure. [SLEEP A LOT BETTER] It will be nothing but peaceful nights. If you get sore hips, or your legs fall asleep from laying on your side, you need a knee pillow to increase circulation and reduce pressure. You will wake up more energetic and fresh in the morning with a good balance of firmness and support with this pillow. It will seriously improve your quality of sleep, and positively impact your waking hours too! [EASY TO CLEAN WITH A REMOVABLE COVER] The outer pillow cover is made with extremely soft and removable plush fabric. Now you can easily remove the pillow cover and pop it in the washing machine. [PERFECT GIFT IDEA] Do you know someone who could really use a good night's sleep? Our luxurious knee pillow makes a great gift for family members, friends, pregnant co-workers, people recovering from surgery, those suffering from lower back, hip, or Sciatica pain and anyone else looking for better sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xzPIA7kNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexicomfort","source_asin":"B08RBFHVLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RBFHVLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RBFHVLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
