window.products.push({"id":740708,"name":"MOKIUER Shower Cup Holder Wine Glass Holder,Self Adhesived or Wall Mount with Screws,Stainless Steel,Brushed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CSrwtMMSS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Specification: Product name: wine glass holder in shower / bathtub wine glass holderMaterial: 304 Stainless steel BrushedTwo installation methods: self-adhesive or mounted on the wall with screws, you can mount it anywhere, whether it is a smooth surface or a painted wall Package Includes: wine glass holder bathtub* 1pcDouble-sided adhesived * 1pc Screws and anchors* 2pcs About Our Product: adhesived or wall mounted and it won't leave any residue behind.Bathroom, kitchen, anywhere you want to drink, have a glass of wine in hand. How to install: A) Self Adhesive： 1. Wipe the wall surface and dry it (must be smooth surface,not suitable for wall paper or painted wall )2. Then peel off the back protective film of the self-adhesive pad and stick it on the smooth wall surface, then press the hand towel rack for several seconds.3.It is recommended to wait 24 hours before hanging anything to ensure the product is firmly fixed. B）Wall Mount： 1. line up the base on the wall and mark the positions of two holes on wall.2. Drill holes on the marked position, then tap the plastic anchors into holes.3. Line up the towel rack and insert the two stainless steel screws through the base holes then into anchors and turn the screws tight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CSrwtMMSS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOKIUER","source_asin":"B092TWVJYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092TWVJYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092TWVJYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
