window.products.push({"id":740722,"name":"Hexagram Decorative Sunflower Pillow Covers 16x16, Buffalo Plaid Farmhouse Throw Pillow Cover Set of 4 for Living Room Sofa Couch Bed Patio Indoor Out","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zArklHvQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable Linen 【 Soft & Durable 】farmhouse buffalo plaid colored sunflower throw pillow covers is made of high quality cotton linen, soft and durable, used for indoor and outdoor, living room, couch, bed farmhouse spring summer home decorations. 【 Sunflower Themed Decorative Pillow Covers 16 x 16 】16 x 16 inch outdoor sunflower pillow covers set of 4, would be plenty full with the 16*16 inch pillow. Pattern is only on the front side. Only have pillow cover, INSERT IS NOT INCLUDED. 4 pieces are included in the package.Decor your home with sunflower throw pillows, add bright and beautiful colors. 【 Beautiful Farmhouse Buffalo Plaid Sunflower Room Decor for living room couch bedding sets 】Cute farmhouse sunflower, rustic cow, black white buffalo plaid truck pattern clearly printed on the spring summer decor throw pillow cover set of 4, vivid colors is just as picture shows. Perfect seasonal spring summer home decorations for living room, bedding, couch, sofa, patio bench, loveseat, car, indoor and outdoor. 【 Washable & Colorful, Colors Keep Fresh As New 】There is durable hidden zipper included with the durable decorative farmhouse sunflower home decor throw pillows, easy to put your pillow insert on/ off. Washable in the cold water, dry it like other daily things, color will keep freash new, would not fade. 【 Popular Sunflowers Pillow Covers Home Decoration Gift 】Our decorative sunflower pillow covers 16 x 16 set of 4 printed with cute yellow sunflower pattern, black white buffalo plaid truck, and vibrant cow pattern, would be a perfect sunflower home decor gift for family/ friends, or decor your own room. Rustic cute spring summer sunflowers pattern helps u creating perfect seasonal spring and summer atmosphere, decor your living room with sunflower design, and get a lot of compliments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zArklHvQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hexagram","source_asin":"B0BSFBLVV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSFBLVV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSFBLVV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":740723,"name":"PASSENGER PIGEON Zebra Cordless Window Blinds, 23 W x 60 H Inches, White, Premium Light Filtering Horizontal Day and Night Dual Layer Sheer Blinds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617DCI+DnXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 1/4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 3.5inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.5inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Solid color roller shade. Feature: 50% Blackout Waterproof Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617DCI+DnXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B075HTQY3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075HTQY3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075HTQY3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
