window.products.push({"id":740764,"name":"JONATHAN Y Contemporary POP Modern Abstract Cream/Blue 8 ft. x 10 ft. Area-Rug, Bohemian, Easy-Cleaning, for Bedroom, Kitchen, Living Room, Non Sheddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1zxf4FMMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As if dabbed with an artist's brush right onto your floor, the vibrant colors and soft texture of this rug will have your guests thinking it is a real masterpiece. A contemporary composition of coral, red, gold, navy, blue, and cream, it is an accent designed to fit many color palettes. Pair with chunky textured fabrics and rattan for a boho look, or sleek minimalist furnishings for a more modern take. Actual Dimension: 7 ft. 9 in. x 10 ft. Color: Cream/Blue Thickness measures: 0.35 in. Vacuum regularly and spot clean as needed; avoid direct and continuous exposure to sunlight; use brushless vacuum; remove spills immediately; if liquid, blot with clean, undyed cloth by pressing firmly around the spill to absorb as much as possible; for hard to remove stains, professional rug cleaning is recommended; store in a dry, well ventilated area and rotate for consistent wear . The JONATHAN Y Rug Collection creates modern area rugs inspired by ancient rug traditions from around the globe. We believe that affordable rugs should be fabulous…. and the more choice, the better! Our trend-worthy designs are durable and easy-care, so they’re ideal for busy lifestyles. Whether you love Boho-chic colors or Minimalist neutrals, we’ll style your floors at a price you’ll love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1zxf4FMMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JONATHAN Y","source_asin":"B081SG5C47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081SG5C47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081SG5C47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
