window.products.push({"id":740829,"name":"SALLOUS Camping Fan with LED Light, 20000mAh Rechargeable Battery Operated Table Fan, Auto-Oscillating Tent Fan with Remote & Hook, 4 Speed Portable C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mec8l4fDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"20000mAh CAPACITY BATTERY: The SALLOUS's camping fan with built-in 20,000 mAh rechargeable battery that can be fully charged in 9-10 hrs and provides 8-200 hrs of use, depending on the features of the fan you choose to determine (including air speed, brightness, and oscillation). Equipped with 5V/3A type-C input/output port and 5V/2A USB output port design, and can be used as a power bank supply for other devices. AUTO-OSCILLATE & DOUBLE TRIBLADES: The SALLOUS table fan can auto-oscillate horizontally within 45°or 90°, and 360°rotate to suit your needs. This camping fan is equipped with double tri-blades design, which provides powerful and soft airflow. The fan has a hook attached to the underside of the base allowing it to be hanged from a clothes line or tree branch to better move air in any desired way.` SUPER BRIGHT WITH 16 LED BEADS: The camping fan has a ring light with 3 levels brightness setting with the top setting being a really bright.. You can adjust 3 different brightness levels according to your needs, making you feel more secure in the dark. No need to find a flashlight when you need to quickly find something. DOUBLE-ADJUSTABLE DESIGN: The fan is equipped with five buttons for different functions, also with a remote that conveniently slides into the side of the base. Instead of walking to the fan every time you need to adjust something, you can use the remote to make adjustments from afar. Note: Please remove the insulation strip before using the remote. EQUIPPED WITH TIMER AND HOOK: The portable fan has a sleep timer, so it doeasn't have to run all day or night (it can be timed for 1H, 2H, 4H, 8H). A built-in hook makes it handy to hang anywhere. There is 4 speed settings and the highest is powerful. Whichever speed you adjust, your family can rest in a quiet and cool environment. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: If you have any question with SALLOUS's CAMPING FAN, feel free contact us (even if outside the Amazon return window), we will provide 6 month warranty or replace service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mec8l4fDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SALLOUS","source_asin":"B0BWMS7XY3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMS7XY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMS7XY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
