window.products.push({"id":740833,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon 550-Gram Turkish Cotton Washcloth, Soft Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iNAEo5fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the quality and softness of Turkish cotton bath linens at home with this Pinzon washcloth. Terry woven for fluffiness, the lightweight, yet highly absorbent cloth is crafted in Turkey from 90-percent low twist cotton/ 10-percent rayon in single-ply yarns. The fabric dries faster than ordinary cotton fabric and weighs in at 550 grams per square meter. Featuring strong seams and classic dobby borders, the handsome washcloth is available in a choice of versatile colors and measures 13 by 13 inches. Combine it with Pinzon's 550-Gram Turkish Cotton hand towels and bath towels for a complete bath collection. Care Instructions: For cleaning, machine wash separately in cold water, using only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low, remove promptly, and warm iron as needed. To best care for this product, please exclusively follow the washing instructions on the label. Fabric softeners should not be used when washing or drying, since softeners often include chemicals that can break down the construction of the material and decrease its absorbency. In addition, take care to avoid direct contact between this product's fabric and chemical acids or bleaches often found in many cosmetics. Certain cosmetics such as facial care products, creams, makeup, and makeup removers contain chemical acids and/or bleaches which can discolor fabric. These chemicals do not dissolve in water and may cling to the fabric when wiped against the skin, leading to a discoloration that appears as spots or splotches. Generally, it's best to use a towel or cloth with white fabric when removing facial creams and similar products from the face. Likewise, discolorations may also occur when attempting to spot-clean stains with bar soap. Certain bar soaps also contain high acidity levels and/or dyes that can discolor fabric.Oeko-Tex Certified. This product is certified by Oeko-Tex, the globally recognized and trusted testing system for ecologically safe textiles. An Amazon Brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iNAEo5fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B007P0WOZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007P0WOZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007P0WOZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
