window.products.push({"id":740841,"name":"Damascus Steel Knife Set 18Pcs Non Stick Sharp Kitchen Knives Set with Block 8 pieces Steak Knife Sharpener Shears Cutlery Knives Block Set Chef Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dz+kRpYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Knife Set for Your Cutting Needs - - This 18 Pieces knife set includes 1x 8\" Chef Knife 1x 8\" Carving Knife 1x 8\" Bread Knife 1x 3.5\" Paring Knife 1x 5\" Utility Knife 1x Sharperer 1x Kitchen Shears 6x Steak Knives 1x Peeler 1x Acrylic Knife Stand. All the cooking knives you need in one pack. High-Quality Material to Cutting Items - - This stainless steel knife is made of stainless steel, doesn’t contain any heavy metals and chemical elements. It will not react chemically with food, leave residue or emit an odor when used, allowing food to retain its original flavor and freshness for longer. Non Stick & Damascus Texture and Thick Knife Blade Design - - Unique Forging & Damascus Texture Knife Blade makes this knife nonstick,and easy to maintain. Our tough stainless steel knives are not only sharp, also lightweight, comfortable to hold, and easy to grip. Easily cut anything (such as meat, bread, fruits, and vegetables) and let you enjoy the fun of cooking. Colors Optional and Modern Acrylic Decor & Ideal Gift - Our knife set will come with a acrylic stand that is beautiful and space-saving. Makes it easy for you to pick up the knife you need. Colors for you, Perfectly adapted to all kinds of kitchen styles. Also can be a great gift option for family and friends on birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, housewarming days, etc. Easy To Clean - - After using the kitchen knife set, simply rinse quickly and wipe with a kitchen towel, (Take care when cleaning to prevent cutting fingers). It’s an essential and practical kitchen cutting tools, by the way if became dull after using for many times you can sharp it with a sharping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dz+kRpYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WopZra","source_asin":"B0B73SZFKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B73SZFKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B73SZFKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
