window.products.push({"id":740868,"name":"LVKH 2 Silicone Pinch Mitt Set with 4 Small Trivets (6 Piece Set)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MrDAG+uEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LVKH SILICONE TRIVET SET With this 6-pack set of LVKH silicone trivets, you can bake or slow cook anything you want. These trivets are made for quick simple tasks where you have to take something out of the oven and put it onto the counter. They also add a bright look to your kitchen and remind you to smile. This set comes with a KITCHEN ESSENTIAL pinch mitts, perfect for taking things out of the oven or microwave and for moving hot pots! Details -Oven-safe up to 480 degrees F -COMES WITH 2 PINCH MITTS PERFECT FOR FAST TASKS -4 Small Simple Trivets for Light Tasks Trivets The set comes with four simple small trivets. The four small trivets are perfect for smaller basic tasks where you want a trivet. The small trivets are not suitable for heavy duty work. OUR STORY Founded by school teachers Adam and Edna during their first year of marriage in 2018, LVKH is a kitchenware brand with inspiring reminders to live in the present. Our vision for our products was to create more than cooking tools, we wanted to create a community where people could live better by surrounding themselves with upbeat messages for healthy living, mindfulness, and living a life with gratefulness. It was also important for us to create real messages with our clients and understand what motivates and uplifts them. We live a life we love and we find constant upbeat reminders help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MrDAG+uEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LVKH EST. 2018","source_asin":"B07GRB68GQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GRB68GQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GRB68GQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
