window.products.push({"id":740944,"name":"Heat Resistant Fine Porcelain Casserole/Clay Pot/Earthenware Pot (1600ml Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yviL8gTaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Love & Art Heat Resistant Fine Porcelain Casserole with Lid 1600ml Red color. Materials: Lid & Body - Made from fine porcelain: Petalite (ultra high temperature firing). Lid Knob - Bakelite. Porcelain is ceramic — both are made by coating clay tiles with a glaze and heating them to change the chemistry of the clay and melt the glaze to a glass-like coating. \"Porcelain\" floor tiles are made of a more dense clay and heated to a higher temperature than \"ceramic\" tiles. Temperature range: -20'C ~ 500'C (break protection). Features: 1. ergonomically designed pot handles are heat resistant for safety and convenience. 2. High quality bakelite knob is also heat resistant, non-slip and waterproof for easy grip and use. 3. Deep depth heating pot prevents food from over flowing from pot. Also when cooking, heat is distributed evenly for convenient cooking, and keeps food warm for long period of time. High quality natural heat resistant clay used for ceramic glazing of pot is eco-friendly, harmless to human body, food safe, and hygienic. Can cook on flame, gas, and radiant cookers. It is microwave safe, dishwasher safe and freezer safe. If put the pot into microwave oven, please remember to take off the lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yviL8gTaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love is Art","source_asin":"B07ZG5W4LK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-740944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZG5W4LK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZG5W4LK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
